<h3 class="govuk-heading-m">Play it through to the bot</h3>

<p class="govuk-body">Same pattern as step 6: dial the council's number on your mobile, hold the phone next to your computer speaker, click play.</p>

<p class="govuk-body">Listen for the moment the voice switches from Amy (en-GB) to Bianca (it-IT). It happens between turn 1 and turn 2, after Bedrock detects Italian from the first transcript segment.</p>

