<h3 class="govuk-heading-m">Try another language live</h3>

<p class="govuk-body">After the English greeting, the bot listens to your first reply and detects the language. From turn 2 onward, the voice and the answers switch to that language. To try Italian live without the recording: dial the number and say <em>"Quando passa il netturbino?"</em> (When does the bin lorry come?). The bot replies in Italian via Bianca, with the same Aldershire knowledge base behind it.</p>

